            "review_text": "Travelly HN\nHanoi, Vietnam57 contributions\n0\nMust-try local drink!\nMay 2022\nI promise this is not just a drink, it is our street drink culture. \n\nYou can buy this drink anywhere in Hanoi but what makes this place special is the experience of sitting on the pavement watching the view of St joseph Cathedal and drinking the best lemon iced tea. This drink is different from the others as in Asia, we use limes (which look like lemon but is smaller and green) instead of lemon to cook. \n\nPrice: Quite reasonable for the experience (~$1/cup)\n\nP/s: The staff is really cute and hospitable even though serving hundreds of customers per day.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 14, 2022",
