            "review_text": "LucaCampana\nMacleod, Australia102 contributions\n0\nGreen Lemon Iced Tea, some roasted sunflowers seeds and the best view of St Joseph Cathedral\nMar 2016 • Family\nSo the tea is delish, the sunflowers seeds a super fund and the view is amazing. Sat here a couple of days in a row with my wife and 3yo and 5yo relaxing and just taking in the city. The kids thought the sunflowers seeds, tossing the shells on the ground, were awesome (and they did taste good) but the tea is really pleasant and the energy of the local area with the cathedral is just peaceful and special. I've never seen a green lemon until vietnam, but its a flavour some place between a lime and a lemon and its wonderful.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 31, 2016",
