            "review_text": "PeterTadvisor\nGunnison, Colorado1177 contributions\n0\nA very popular local hangout.\nMar 2016 • Friends\nI'm giving this little hangout place a 3 dot rating because of its novelty and how well loved it is by their following. If you like drinking tea and eating sunflower seeds then this little Cafe is calling your name. It's not just a local hangout but many backpackers join in and take a seat on one of the little plastic stools and eat seeds and watch people on this popular corner across the street from the big church. Give it a try and build some Memories\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2016",
